(text "TPS25974L: 1k sets 5.75 A nominal breaker threshold for 5 A service. ITIMER open; latch-off.\nILM is BOTH current setting and monitoring: 105.5 uA/A x 1k = 0.1055 V/A; 0.528 V at 5 A.\n10k/10n filter isolates ADC capacitance from ILM. Calibrate channels; do not attach a capacitor directly to ILM.\nIndependent local OVLO: 150k/10k -> 19.2 V nominal. PG threshold: 100k/20k -> 7.2 V nominal.\nPositive line switched; ground permanently connected. No reverse blocking: do not backfeed outputs.\nIN pad5 / OUT pad6 are power/thermal rails, NOT GND. Reserve copper and thermal-via space.\nTVS1800 flat clamp replaces SMBJ18A: 24.7 V max at specified 35 A / 8-20 us / 125 C pulse; verify loop overshoot." (at 25.4000 246.3800 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1aaac311-8201-5b58-809f-7fa23a0d3b47"))
